    "title": "Harris County had 11 more active licenses to practice law in February than previous month",
    "text": "State Bar of New Mexico.\nThere were 171 active legal licenses in Harris County in February, compared to 160 the month before.\nData refers to all lawyers who were actively practicing during this time period.\nAs of 2023, the average salary for a lawyer in New Mexico is approximately $96,071 per year.\nNew Mexico faces a severe shortage of lawyers. Two of its counties have no attorneys, and 21% of the state's counties have no more than five lawyers.\nNote that the table below does not represent all lawyers with active licenses to practice.\nLawyer Name | Name of Firm |\n---|---|\nAaron K. Thompson | McCarthy & Associates |\nAaron Patrick Williams | |\nAdam A. Milasincic | The Ammons Law Firm, LLP |\nAdam T. Funk | Funk Law Group, PLLC |\nAdrian L. Griggs | |\nAlexander Aron Kuiper | Kuiper Law Firm |\nAlison C. Batarse | Serpe Andrews |\nAmber Rose Schilling | Schouest Bamdas Soshea & BenMaier, PLLC |\nAndrew J. Willey | Property Tax Litigator |\nAndrew R. McCarthy | Amini Law Firm, PLLC |\nAndrew Robert Potts | Kirby Mathews & Walrath, PLLC |\nAndy Tim Yun Yip | |\nAnna G. Hamilton | University of Houston Equal Opportunity Services Office |\nAnnie Briggs | Toeppich and Associates |\nBenjamin C. Feiler | McGehee Chang Landgraf Feiler |\nBenjamin L. Bosell | Chevron USA, Inc. |\nBenjamin T. Landgraf | McGehee Chang Landgraf Feiler |\nBradford M. Moody | Henneman Rau Kirklin & Smith, LLP |\nBrent L. Moss | Marks Balette Young & Moss, PLLC |\nBrian Henry Zygo | Amini Law Firm, PLLC |\nBrian Lee Tiller | Steven S. Toeppich & Associates, PLLC |\nBrian Thomas Wittpenn | Kearney McWilliams & Davis |\nBruce P. Murchison | Immigration and Customs Enforcement |\nBryon Allyn Rice | Hicks Davis Wynn, P.C. |\nCarson Whittemore Badger | Toeppich & Associates, PLLC |\nCatherine A. Balli | |\nCharlie Henke | Henke & Williams, LLP |\nChristopher C. Waggoner | |\nChristopher Garrett King | Hampton & King |\nChristopher M. Hogan | Hogan Thompson Schuelke, LLP |\nClarissa 